{"id":"631803","name":"炸糖糕","author":"红•宏","authorId":"10737312","desc":"","cover":"images/631803/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪油","amount":"20g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"15g"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"30g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/631803/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中加250凉水，白糖放进去。","img":"images/631803/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪油和花生油放进去。","img":"images/631803/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用勺子化开将水烧开。","img":"images/631803/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克面粉放进去用筷子搅拌。","img":"images/631803/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"成型后关火。","img":"images/631803/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放在案板上切成小块晾凉。","img":"images/631803/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"里面加适量凉白开将面揉光滑。","img":"images/631803/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"醒20分钟。","img":"images/631803/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取一大碗，里面加适量红糖和面粉。","img":"images/631803/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/631803/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搓成长条。","img":"images/631803/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"切成小段，压扁，将红糖放进去，用虎口收起，压扁即可。","img":"images/631803/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"锅中倒油，油温七成热将做好的糖糕放进去，先不要翻面，待固定后炸至两面金黄捞出。","img":"images/631803/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"色泽金黄，香酥脆甜。","img":"images/631803/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"近照。","img":"images/631803/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"炸糖糕是，要中小火，火大了就会皮焦里面不好熟。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}